{"seq":1,"slug":"canary-releases","title":"金丝雀发布：流量切分、健康指标与自动回滚","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/feature-flags-progressive-delivery/progressive-delivery/canary-releases","wordCount":2023,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"金丝雀发布-流量切分-健康指标与自动回滚\">金丝雀发布：流量切分、健康指标与自动回滚</h1><h2 id=\"引言-煤矿中的金丝雀\">引言：煤矿中的金丝雀</h2><p>金丝雀发布（Canary Release）得名于历史上煤矿工人携带金丝雀鸟进入矿井的做法——金丝雀对有毒气体极其敏感，若金丝雀死亡则矿工需立即撤离。在软件工程中，金丝雀发布将新版本先暴露给一小部分流量（通常 1-5%），通过监控健康指标来判断新版本是否安全。</p>\n<p>研究表明，采用金丝雀发布的组织比全量部署减少 <strong>60-80%</strong> 的生产事故。Google、Netflix、Facebook 等公司每天进行数百次金丝雀发布，这一模式是支撑高频部署的关键安全网。</p>\n<p>金丝雀发布是渐进交付（Progressive Delivery）最核心的策略之一。与 <a href=\"blue-green-ring-deployments\">蓝绿部署</a>的&quot;二选一&quot;切换不同，金丝雀是<strong>渐进式</strong>的——流量比例从 1% 逐步提升到 5%、10%、25%、50%、100%，每一步都有数据支撑的决策。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>金丝雀发布的核心思想是<strong>用最小的爆炸半径验证变更的安全性</strong>：先把新版本暴露给一小部分真实流量，用健康指标判断它是否安全，再决定扩大还是回滚。</p>\n<p>这一策略由三个支柱构成，也是本节展开的主线：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>流量切分</strong>：在基础设施层（服务网格/LB 权重，请求级）或应用层（特性开关，用户级粘性）控制新版本接收的流量比例；</li>\n<li><strong>健康信号</strong>：与对照组做统计学显著性对比，而非简单阈值判断，覆盖系统指标与业务指标；</li>\n<li><strong>自动回滚</strong>：任何阶段指标异常即把流量切回旧版本——回滚是流量路由变更，无需重新部署。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"金丝雀发布的核心流程\">金丝雀发布的核心流程</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    Deploy[代码部署] --&gt; C1[金丝雀 1%]&#10;    C1 --&gt; Check1{健康?}&#10;    Check1 -- 是 --&gt; C2[扩大 5%]&#10;    Check1 -- 否 --&gt; RB1[回滚]&#10;    C2 --&gt; Check2{健康?}&#10;    Check2 -- 是 --&gt; C3[大规模 25%]&#10;    Check2 -- 否 --&gt; RB2[回滚]&#10;    C3 --&gt; Check3{健康?}&#10;    Check3 -- 是 --&gt; C4[全量发布 100%]&#10;    Check3 -- 否 --&gt; RB3[回滚]&#10;    C4 --&gt; Stable[稳定运行]\">flowchart LR\n    Deploy[代码部署] --&gt; C1[金丝雀 1%]\n    C1 --&gt; Check1{健康?}\n    Check1 -- 是 --&gt; C2[扩大 5%]\n    Check1 -- 否 --&gt; RB1[回滚]\n    C2 --&gt; Check2{健康?}\n    Check2 -- 是 --&gt; C3[大规模 25%]\n    Check2 -- 否 --&gt; RB2[回滚]\n    C3 --&gt; Check3{健康?}\n    Check3 -- 是 --&gt; C4[全量发布 100%]\n    Check3 -- 否 --&gt; RB3[回滚]\n    C4 --&gt; Stable[稳定运行]</pre><h3 id=\"各阶段详解\">各阶段详解</h3><p><strong>阶段 0 — 部署但不暴露</strong>：新版本部署到生产基础设施，但不接收任何真实流量。此时可以进行 Smoke Test 和内部验证。</p>\n<p><strong>阶段 1 — 金丝雀启动（1-5%）</strong>：将一小部分真实流量路由到新版本。这是风险最小的验证阶段——即使新版本完全崩溃，影响面也仅为 1-5% 用户。</p>\n<p><strong>阶段 2 — 逐步扩大（5% → 25% → 50%）</strong>：每次扩大前需确认上一阶段的健康指标稳定。扩大的步长和等待时间取决于团队的风险容忍度和变更的影响面。</p>\n<p><strong>阶段 3 — 全量发布（100%）</strong>：所有用户使用新版本。保持旧版本就绪一段时间（通常 24-72 小时）以备回滚。</p>\n<p><strong>回滚</strong>：任何阶段如果健康指标异常，立即将流量切回旧版本。回滚不需要重新部署——只是流量路由的变更。</p>\n<h2 id=\"流量切分机制\">流量切分机制</h2><h3 id=\"基于基础设施的流量切分\">基于基础设施的流量切分</h3><p>在 Kubernetes 环境中，流量切分通常通过以下方式实现：</p>\n<h4 id=\"istio-服务网格\">Istio 服务网格</h4><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# Istio VirtualService — 5% 流量到金丝雀&#10;apiVersion: networking.istio.io/v1beta1&#10;kind: VirtualService&#10;metadata:&#10;  name: my-service&#10;spec:&#10;  hosts:&#10;    - my-service&#10;  http:&#10;    - route:&#10;        - destination:&#10;            host: my-service&#10;            subset: stable&#10;          weight: 95&#10;        - destination:&#10;            host: my-service&#10;            subset: canary&#10;          weight: 5&#10;---&#10;apiVersion: networking.istio.io/v1beta1&#10;kind: DestinationRule&#10;metadata:&#10;  name: my-service&#10;spec:&#10;  host: my-service&#10;  subsets:&#10;    - name: stable&#10;      labels:&#10;        version: v1.2.0&#10;    - name: canary&#10;      labels:&#10;        version: v1.3.0\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Istio VirtualService — 5% 流量到金丝雀</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">apiVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">networking.istio.io/v1beta1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">VirtualService</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">metadata</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">my-service</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">spec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  hosts</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">my-service</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  http</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">route</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">destination</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">            host</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">my-service</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">            subset</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">stable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          weight</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">95</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">destination</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">            host</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">my-service</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">            subset</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">canary</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          weight</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">---</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">apiVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">networking.istio.io/v1beta1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">DestinationRule</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">metadata</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">my-service</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">spec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  host</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">my-service</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  subsets</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">stable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      labels</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">v1.2.0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">canary</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      labels</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">v1.3.0</span></span></code></pre></div><h4 id=\"nginx-ingress-注解\">NGINX Ingress + 注解</h4><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# 轻量级方案：NGINX Ingress Canary 注解&#10;apiVersion: networking.k8s.io/v1&#10;kind: Ingress&#10;metadata:&#10;  name: my-service-canary&#10;  annotations:&#10;    nginx.ingress.kubernetes.io/canary: &#39;true&#39;&#10;    nginx.ingress.kubernetes.io/canary-weight: &#39;5&#39;&#10;spec:&#10;  rules:&#10;    - host: api.example.com&#10;      http:&#10;        paths:&#10;          - path: /&#10;            backend:&#10;              service:&#10;                name: my-service-canary&#10;                port:&#10;                  number: 80\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 轻量级方案：NGINX Ingress Canary 注解</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">apiVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">networking.k8s.io/v1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Ingress</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">metadata</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">my-service-canary</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  annotations</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    nginx.ingress.kubernetes.io/canary</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'true'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    nginx.ingress.kubernetes.io/canary-weight</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'5'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">spec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  rules</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">host</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">api.example.com</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      http</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        paths</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">path</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">            backend</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">              service</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">                name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">my-service-canary</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">                port</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">                  number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">80</span></span></code></pre></div><h4 id=\"argo-rollouts\">Argo Rollouts</h4><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# Argo Rollouts — 声明式金丝雀策略&#10;apiVersion: argoproj.io/v1alpha1&#10;kind: Rollout&#10;metadata:&#10;  name: my-service&#10;spec:&#10;  strategy:&#10;    canary:&#10;      steps:&#10;        - setWeight: 5&#10;        - pause: { duration: 10m } # 观测 10 分钟&#10;        - setWeight: 25&#10;        - pause: { duration: 30m } # 观测 30 分钟&#10;        - setWeight: 50&#10;        - pause: { duration: 1h } # 观测 1 小时&#10;        - setWeight: 100&#10;      analysis:&#10;        templates:&#10;          - templateName: success-rate&#10;        startingStep: 1 # 从第一步开始分析\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Argo Rollouts — 声明式金丝雀策略</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">apiVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">argoproj.io/v1alpha1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;-