        - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">setWeight</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">25</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">pause</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">duration</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">30m</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 观测 30 分钟</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">setWeight</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">50</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">pause</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">duration</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">1h</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 观测 1 小时</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">setWeight</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      analysis</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        templates</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">templateName</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">success-rate</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        startingStep</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 从第一步开始分析</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"基于应用层的流量切分\">基于应用层的流量切分</h3><p>与基础设施层面的流量切分不同，应用层通过特性开关实现&quot;逻辑金丝雀&quot;——同一服务实例内部，根据用户标识路由到不同代码路径：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"def handle_request(request, user):&#10;    context = EvaluationContext(targeting_key=user.id)&#10;&#10;    if feature_flags.get_boolean(&quot;new-search-engine&quot;, context, False):&#10;        # 金丝雀路径：新搜索引擎&#10;        return new_search_engine.search(request.query)&#10;    else:&#10;        # 稳定路径：旧搜索引擎&#10;        return legacy_search.search(request.query)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> handle_request</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(request, user):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    context </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> EvaluationContext(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">targeting_key</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">user.id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> feature_flags.get_boolean(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"new-search-engine\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, context, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">False</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        # 金丝雀路径：新搜索引擎</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> new_search_engine.search(request.query)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    else</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        # 稳定路径：旧搜索引擎</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> legacy_search.search(request.query)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>两种方式的对比：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>基础设施层</th>\n<th>应用层</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>粒度</td>\n<td>请求级（随机）</td>\n<td>用户级（粘性）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>一致性</td>\n<td>同一用户可能交替命中新旧版本</td>\n<td>同一用户始终看到同一版本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>部署要求</td>\n<td>需要并行运行两套服务实例</td>\n<td>单实例内多代码路径</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>回滚速度</td>\n<td>流量路由变更（秒级）</td>\n<td>开关翻转（毫秒级）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用场景</td>\n<td>整体服务升级</td>\n<td>单功能灰度</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>实际生产中通常<strong>两者结合</strong>：基础设施层面控制服务版本的流量权重，应用层面通过开关控制单个功能的灰度百分比。详见 <a href=\"percentage-rollout-strategies\">百分比灰度策略</a> 中的粘性哈希实现。</p>\n<h2 id=\"健康指标-health-signals\">健康指标（Health Signals）</h2><p>金丝雀发布的有效性完全依赖于<strong>指标质量</strong>。必须在金丝雀阶段监控以下维度的指标，并与对照组（稳定版本）做对比分析：</p>\n<h3 id=\"系统指标-sli\">系统指标（SLI）</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>告警阈值示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>错误率</td>\n<td>5xx/总请求</td>\n<td>&gt;baseline×1.5</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>P50 延迟</td>\n<td>请求延迟中位数</td>\n<td>&gt;baseline×1.2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>P99 延迟</td>\n<td>尾部延迟</td>\n<td>&gt;baseline×2.0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CPU 使用率</td>\n<td>容器 CPU</td>\n<td>&gt;80%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内存使用率</td>\n<td>容器 Memory</td>\n<td>&gt;85%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Crash Rate</td>\n<td>客户端崩溃率</td>\n<td>&gt;baseline×1.1</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"业务指标\">业务指标</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>告警阈值示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>转化率</td>\n<td>核心转化漏斗</td>\n<td>&lt;baseline×0.95</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DAU/MAU</td>\n<td>活跃用户数</td>\n<td>&lt;baseline×0.98</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>收入/用户</td>\n<td>ARPU</td>\n<td>&lt;baseline×0.95</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>操作完成率</td>\n<td>核心流程完成率</td>\n<td>&lt;baseline×0.97</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"对比分析方法\">对比分析方法</h3><p>金丝雀指标必须与对照组做<strong>统计学显著性比较</strong>，而非简单的阈值判断：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"# 伪代码：金丝雀健康评估&#10;def evaluate_canary_health(canary_metrics, baseline_metrics, config):&#10;    results = []&#10;&#10;    for metric_name, threshold in config.metrics.items():&#10;        canary_value = canary_metrics[metric_name]&#10;        baseline_value = baseline_metrics[metric_name]&#10;&#10;        # 计算相对变化&#10;        relative_change = (canary_value - baseline_value) / baseline_value&#10;&#10;        # 统计检验（Mann-Whitney U test 或 Welch&#39;s t-test）&#10;        p_value = statistical_test(canary_samples, baseline_samples)&#10;&#10;        if relative_change &gt; threshold and p_value &lt; 0.05:&#10;            results.append(HealthResult(metric_name, &quot;DEGRADED&quot;, relative_change))&#10;        else:&#10;            results.append(HealthResult(metric_name, &quot;HEALTHY&quot;, relative_change))&#10;&#10;    # 任一关键指标退化 → 整体不健康&#10;    if any(r.status == &quot;DEGRADED&quot; for r in results if r.is_critical):&#10;        return OverallHealth.UNHEALTHY&#10;    return OverallHealth.HEALTHY\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 伪代码：金丝雀健康评估</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> evaluate_canary_health</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(canary_metrics, baseline_metrics, config):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    results </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> metric_name, threshold </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> config.metrics.items():</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        canary_value </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> canary_metrics[metric_name]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        baseline_value </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> baseline_metrics[metric_name]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        # 计算相对变化</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        relative_change </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (canary_value </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> baseline_value) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> baseline_value</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        # 统计检验（Mann-Whitney U test 或 Welch's t-test）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        p_value </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> statistical_test(canary_samples, baseline_samples)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> relative_change </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> threshold </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">and</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> p_value </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.05</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            results.append(HealthResult(metric_name, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"DEGRADED\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, relative_change))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        else</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            results.append(HealthResult(metric_name, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"HEALTHY\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, relative_change))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # 任一关键指标退化 → 整体不健康</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> any</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(r.status </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"DEGRADED\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> r </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> results </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> r.is_critical):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> OverallHealth.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">UNHEALTHY</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> OverallHealth.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">HEALTHY</span></span></code></pre></div><p>与 <a href=\"../../observability/\">可观测性</a>平台的深度集成是金丝雀分析的基础。Prometheus + Grafana 是最常见的指标采集与可视化栈；Datadog、New Relic 等 SaaS 平台提供内建的金丝雀分析功能。</p>\n<h2 id=\"自动回滚策略\">自动回滚策略</h2><h3 id=\"基于指标的自动回滚\">基于指标的自动回滚</h3><p>当健康指标突破预设阈值时，自动触发回滚：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# Argo Rollouts AnalysisTemplate&#10;apiVersion: argoproj.io/v1alpha1&#10;kind: AnalysisTemplate&#10;metadata:&#10;  name: success-rate&#10;spec:&#10;  metrics:&#10;    - name: success-rate&#10;      interval: 1m&#10;      successCondition: result[0] &gt;= 0.95&#10;      failureLimit: 3 # 连续 3 次失败触发回滚&#10;      provider:&#10;        prometheus:&#10;          address: http://prometheus:9090&#10;          query: |&#10;            sum(rate(http_requests_total{status=~&quot;2..&quot;,app=&quot;my-service&quot;,version=&quot;canary&quot;}[5m]))&#10;            /&#10;            sum(rate(http_requests_total{app=&quot;my-service&quot;,version=&quot;canary&quot;}[5m]))\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Argo Rollouts AnalysisTemplate</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">apiVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">argoproj.io/v1alpha1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">AnalysisTemplate</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">metadata</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">success-rate</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">spec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  metrics</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">success-rate</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      interval</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">1m</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      successCondition</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">result[0] >= 0.95</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      failureLimit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 连续 3 次失败触发回滚</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      provider</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        prometheus</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          address</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">http://prometheus:9090</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          query</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            sum(rate(http_requests_total{status=~\"2..\",app=\"my-service\",version=\"canary\"}[5m]))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            /</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            sum(rate(http_requests_total{app=\"my-service\",version=\"canary\"}[5m]))</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"回滚触发条件设计\">回滚触发条件设计</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>触发器</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>响应时间</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>错误率飙升</td>\n<td>5xx 率超过阈值</td>\n<td>即时（秒级）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>延迟退化</td>\n<td>P99 显著增加</td>\n<td>1-5 分钟</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Crash 率上升</td>\n<td>客户端崩溃率异常</td>\n<td>5-10 分钟</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>业务指标下降</td>\n<td>转化率/收入下降</td>\n<td>15-60 分钟</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>人工触发</td>\n<td>On-call 工程师判断</td>\n<td>手动即时</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"回滚的执行\">回滚的执行</h3><p>回滚操作应该是<strong>瞬间且安全的</strong>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>将金丝雀流量权重设为 0%</li>\n<li>旧版本继续服务 100% 流量</li>\n<li>金丝雀实例保留（不销毁）用于事后诊断</li>\n<li>创建事故报告/分析工单</li>\n</ol>\n<p>关键原则：<strong>回滚不需要部署</strong>。金丝雀发布的核心优势之一就是回滚只是流量路由的变更，无需重新部署代码。这与 <a href=\"../../site-reliability-engineering/\">SRE 的事故响应</a>原则一致——优先恢复服务，事后再做根因分析。</p>\n<h2 id=\"金丝雀发布的挑战与应对\">金丝雀发布的挑战与应对</h2><h3 id=\"数据库兼容性\">数据库兼容性</h3><p>金丝雀发布要求新旧版本能<strong>同时</strong>访问同一数据库。数据库 schema 变更必须向后兼容：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"推荐策略：Expand-Contract Migration&#10;&#10;1. Expand：新版本添加新列/表，不删除旧结构&#10;2. 金丝雀验证：新旧版本都能正常工作&#10;3. 全量发布后&#10;4. Contract：移除旧列/表（在下一个发布周期）\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>推荐策略：Expand-Contract Migration</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>1. Expand：新版本添加新列/表，不删除旧结构</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>2. 金丝雀验证：新旧版本都能正常工作</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>3. 全量发布后</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>4. Contract：移除旧列/表（在下一个发布周期）</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"有状态服务\">有状态服务</h3><p>对于有状态的服务（如 WebSocket 长连接、缓存预热），金丝雀切换可能导致连接中断或缓存失效。应对策略：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>支持优雅连接迁移（Graceful Connection Draining）</li>\n<li>分离状态与计算（状态存储在共享层如 Redis）</li>\n<li>金丝雀阶段允许足够的预热时间</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"观测窗口的确定\">观测窗口的确定</h3><p>金丝雀应该观测多久？这取决于：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>流量模式</strong>：工作日/周末/高峰/低谷都需覆盖</li>\n<li><strong>指标延迟</strong>：业务指标的观测窗口通常长于系统指标</li>\n<li><strong>变更风险</strong>：核心路径变更需要更长的观测期</li>\n<li><strong>统计显著性</strong>：样本量需要足够才能做出可靠判断</li>\n</ul>\n<p>经验法则：系统指标 10-30 分钟可判断，业务指标至少 1-4 小时甚至 1 天。</p>\n<h2 id=\"工具链生态\">工具链生态</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>工具</th>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Argo Rollouts</td>\n<td>Kubernetes CRD</td>\n<td>声明式金丝雀、与 Prometheus/Datadog 集成</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Flagger</td>\n<td>Kubernetes Operator</td>\n<td>支持 Istio/Linkerd/NGINX/Gloo</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Spinnaker</td>\n<td>持续交付平台</td>\n<td>Netflix 开源，内建金丝雀分析（Kayenta）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Harness</td>\n<td>SaaS 平台</td>\n<td>AI 驱动的自动验证</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>AWS App Mesh</td>\n<td>托管服务网格</td>\n<td>原生金丝雀支持</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>金丝雀发布的核心价值是<strong>用最小的爆炸半径验证变更的安全性</strong>。关键实践：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>渐进扩大</strong>：从 1% 开始，每步有数据支撑的决策</li>\n<li><strong>对比分析</strong>：金丝雀 vs 对照组的统计学显著性检验</li>\n<li><strong>自动化决策</strong>：基于指标的自动推进/自动回滚</li>\n<li><strong>数据库兼容</strong>：新旧版本必须能同时工作</li>\n<li><strong>快速回滚</strong>：回滚是流量切换，不是重新部署</li>\n</ol>\n<p>下一节 <a href=\"blue-green-ring-deployments\">蓝绿部署与环形发布</a> 讨论另一种经典的零停机发布策略，以及 Microsoft 推广的多环验证模式。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"金丝雀发布：流量切分、健康指标与自动回滚","id":"金丝雀发布-流量切分-健康指标与自动回滚"},{"level":2,"text":"引言：煤矿中的金丝雀","id":"引言-煤矿中的金丝雀"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"金丝雀发布的核心流程","id":"金丝雀发布的核心流程"},{"level":3,"text":"各阶段详解","id":"各阶段详解"},{"level":2,"text":"流量切分机制","id":"流量切分机制"},{"level":3,"text":"基于基础设施的流量切分","id":"基于基础设施的流量切分"},{"level":4,"text":"Istio 服务网格","id":"istio-服务网格"},{"level":4,"text":"NGINX Ingress + 注解","id":"nginx-ingress-注解"},{"level":4,"text":"Argo Rollouts","id":"argo-rollouts"},{"level":3,"text":"基于应用层的流量切分","id":"基于应用层的流量切分"},{"level":2,"text":"健康指标（Health Signals）","id":"健康指标-health-signals"},{"level":3,"text":"系统指标（SLI）","id":"系统指标-sli"},{"level":3,"text":"业务指标","id":"业务指标"},{"level":3,"text":"对比分析方法","id":"对比分析方法"},{"level":2,"text":"自动回滚策略","id":"自动回滚策略"},{"level":3,"text":"基于指标的自动回滚","id":"基于指标的自动回滚"},{"level":3,"text":"回滚触发条件设计","id":"回滚触发条件设计"},{"level":3,"text":"回滚的执行","id":"回滚的执行"},{"level":2,"text":"金丝雀发布的挑战与应对","id":"金丝雀发布的挑战与应对"},{"level":3,"text":"数据库兼容性","id":"数据库兼容性"},{"level":3,"text":"有状态服务","id":"有状态服务"},{"level":3,"text":"观测窗口的确定","id":"观测窗口的确定"},{"level":2,"text":"工具链生态","id":"工具链生态"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"目标定向与分群：精细控制功能可见性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/feature-flags-progressive-delivery/foundations/targeting-segmentation"},"next":{"title":"蓝绿部署与环形发布：多环策略与流量路由","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/feature-flags-progressive-delivery/progressive-delivery/blue-green-ring-deployments"}}